        "Sonsogor is the highest elevation peak in Goa, situated in the Sattari taluka of the Western Ghats.",
        "Dudhsagar Waterfalls, one of India's tallest waterfalls, is located on the Mandovi River within the Bhagwan Mahaveer Sanctuary.",
        "The Mahadayi River originates from Degao village in the Khanapur taluka of Belagavi district, Karnataka."
